{# rcs/macros/_cmpid_case.sql.j2
   CMPID CASE expression. The txt_<banner>_<region>_ prefixes are routing keys
   consumed by the downstream message-delivery system, so change them deliberately.
   Included via {% include '_cmpid_case.sql.j2' %} inside every offer-type INSERT.
   Produces a column expression ending in ' AS CMPID'.
   Requires runtime vars in scope: BU_CC_ID, theme, senddate (all set in preamble).

   RCS-only file. PUSH has no equivalent (it uses Push_Campaign_Code instead).
   Divisions and banners mirror the fictional lists in reference_data/.
#}
